    "_comment": [
        "Slice-scoped VM0010 v1.4 block tree.",
        "Structure mirrors the repository precedents:",
        "  Methodology Library/Tutorials/001-hello-world/Hello World.policy  (container + requestVcDocumentBlock)",
        "  Methodology Library/DLT Earth Methodology Bounty Program/VM0047 V1.1/VM0047_1.1.policy  (customLogicBlock + done())",
        "  Methodology Library/Verra/Verified Carbon Standard (VCS)/VM0033/VM0033.policy  (dataTransformationAddon on a submission block)",
        "blockType strings and key sets are taken verbatim from those files.",
        "Field values are development placeholders: no live Hedera account or topic is used."
    ],
    "policy": {
        "name": "VM0010 Improved Forest Management - Vertical Slice",
        "description": "Vertical slice of VM0010 v1.4 Improved Forest Management: Conversion from Logged to Protected Forest. Carries eight baseline-quantification equations as Guardian customLogicBlocks - Appendix 2 Eq 48, Section 8.1.1 Eqs 3/4, Section 8.1.2 Eqs 5/6/7, Section 8.1.3 Eqs 8/11, and Section 8.1.4 Eq 12 as corrected 4 Sept 2026 - plus one Verra Project Hub CUSTOM project description mapping for sectoral scope 14.",
